message: "If you use GeoTask in research, software, or technical reports, please cite this software."
title: "GeoTask: Verifiable Spatiotemporal Task Protocol for AI Agents"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Huang
    given-names: Qian
  - name: GeoTask Contributors
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-07-31
repository-code: "https://github.com/stpku/GeoTask"
url: "https://stpku.github.io/GeoTask/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - spatiotemporal tasks
  - spatial reasoning
  - deterministic verification
  - geospatial
  - robotics
abstract: >-
  GeoTask is an open, verifiable spatiotemporal task protocol for AI agents.
  It represents spatial, temporal, evidential, resource, and action constraints
  as structured tasks and uses deterministic local operators to verify
  model-generated proposals.
